/*
 * stale-keys-note.compact — lab note, not a production contract.
 *
 * Official prove path: https://docs.midnight.network/guides/local-proving
 * Upstream: https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-docs/issues/1377
 *
 * The local-proving page says a keys/circuit mismatch is reported by the
 * prover as "check that your keys match", then tells the builder to recompile.
 * That string is not a Compact assert message. This circuit only asserts a
 * public counter bound so a failed assert stays distinct from that phrase.
 *
 * Not compiled in this change. Does not deploy. Does not claim a public
 * indexer, node, or proof-server fix.
 *
 * Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23. If the compiler rejects `>=`, pin
 * `pragma language_version 0.23;`.
 *
 * Built by @kshot9000 https://x.com/kshot9000
 * Email: kshot9000@gmail.com
 * Cardano donation: addr1q8hnl6vl5a6k3rw3n5g3jtte696zcl76kfatzv7gpswa9r0dj7fma6klq55y4ffm7tf0em09udnyhuk4ah92pl5x9jpqjae44v
 * Teams: @midnightntwrk @MidnightNtwrk @midnightfdn @Cardano @InputOutputHK @cardano-foundation
